              "id": 18098582,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows\nFirefox version: Firefox 151.0 (release)/153\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.theaa.com/route-planner/route?from=g74%204xt&to=FK10%203SA\n2. Observe the map.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nMap gets displayed without any issues.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe route is not visible, black tiles displayed over it.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:d006d2fe-a505-4d0f-a1f4-65233b835165",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Created attachment 9588885\nimage.png\n\n**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows\nFirefox version: Firefox 151.0 (release)/153\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.theaa.com/route-planner/route?from=g74%204xt&to=FK10%203SA\n2. Observe the map.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nMap gets displayed without any issues.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe route is not visible, black tiles displayed over it.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:d006d2fe-a505-4d0f-a1f4-65233b835165",
